   "text": "请求 #2（turn 1 / step 2）\n\nmessages = [\n  system  ← seq 2（字节相同，前缀缓存命中）\n  user    ← seq 3\n  user    runtime-context ← seq 4\n  assistant [thinking, tool_use c1]  ← seq 7\n  tool    result c1  ← seq 9\n]\nrequest/header 与上次 headerEquals → 不重复记录\nTokenMeter：约 5,500 / 128k",
   "originalText": "请求 #2（turn 1 / step 2）\n\nmessages = [\n  system  ← seq 2（字节相同，前缀缓存命中）\n  user    ← seq 3\n  user    runtime-context ← seq 4\n  assistant [thinking, tool_use c1]  ← seq 7\n  tool    result c1  ← seq 9\n]\nrequest/header 与上次 headerEquals → 不重复记录\nTokenMeter：约 5,500 / 128k",
