   "text": "preStep：claim 用户消息「再对比一下港股」→ assemble → agent/pre-step\ncompaction-basic 的串行监听：TokenMeter 计价最新 request 信封\n104k > 阈值 floor(min(128k×0.8, 128k−8k−64k)) = 56k → 触发",
   "originalText": "preStep：claim 用户消息「再对比一下港股」→ assemble → agent/pre-step\ncompaction-basic 的串行监听：TokenMeter 计价最新 request 信封\n104k > 阈值 floor(min(128k×0.8, 128k−8k−64k)) = 56k → 触发",
